at least 2 h and centrifuged at 4°C for 30 min at 16,000 g. After washing the pellet with 80% ethanol, the sample was dissolved in 50 mM Tris-HCl pH 8, 4 M urea. After resuspension, the sample was diluted to 1 M urea with 50 mM Tris-HCl pH 8. 5 U RNase T1 (Thermo Fisher Scientific) and 5 µg RNase A (Roche) were added per mg cross-linked complex and incubated at 52°C for 2 h. Sequencing grade trypsin (Promega) was added at a 24:1 substrate to enzyme ratio and incubated overnight at 37°C. Trypsin was inactivated at 70°C for 10 min. Another 4 U RNase T1 and 4 µg RNase A were added per mg cross-linked complex and incubated at 37°C for 1 hour. Solid-phase extraction using Waters C18 SepPak columns (50 mg) was performed and the samples were evaporated to dryness in a vacuum centrifuge.  The dried sample was dissolved in 86 µL water, 10 µL 10x T4-PNK buffer (NEB), 1 µL 100 mM ATP and 1 µL 100 mM 18O4-gamma-ATP. Labeling was performed with 20 U T4-PNK (NEB) for 1 hour at 37°C. Another solid-phase extraction step was performed as above. The dried sample was dissolved in 60 µL of loading buffer (50% acetonitrile, 300 mg/mL lactic acid, 0.1% trifluoroacetic acid, TFA) and incubated for 30 min with 3 mg equilibrated TiO2-beads (Titansphere PhosTiO 10 µm, GL Sciences). The beads were washed sequentially with 60 µL loading buffer and washing buffer (50% acetonitrile, 0.1% TFA) each and cross-linked peptides were eluted twice with 50 µL elution buffer (50 mM (NH4)2HPO4  pH 10.5) and the solution was immediately acidified by adding TFA. Cross-linked peptides were further purified by C18 StageTip solid phase extraction. Two layers of C18-membranes (3M Empore) were washed sequentially with (1) 100% acetonitrile (ACN), (2) 80% ACN with 0.1% formic acid (FA), (3) two times 5% ACN with 0.1% FA. After applying the sample, the tips were washed three times using 5% ACN with 0.1% FA and finally eluted three times using 50% ACN with 0.1% FA. The eluate was collected in pre-washed LoBind tube